<p>Hey <%= @user.first_name_or_fallback %>,</p>

<p>You asked for a new Dabble Me posting address. Here it is:</p>

<p><strong><%= @user.user_key %>@<%= ENV['SMTP_DOMAIN'] %></strong></p>

<p>
  This email came from that address, so you can save it to your contacts from here.
  Your old address no longer accepts entries, except replies you send from
  <%= @user.email %> to older Dabble Me emails. Update the address anywhere you've saved it.
</p>

<p>
  If you didn't ask for this,
  <%= link_to "change your password", edit_user_registration_url %>
  and check
  <%= link_to "Account Security", security_url %>
  right away.
</p>

<p>
  <br>
  Thanks,
  <br>
  Dabble Me
</p>
